      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786303572267,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Keep telecom pathways out of the hot aisle\nwhere practical; jacket life is a function of\ntemperature.",
      "originalText": "2. Keep telecom pathways out of the hot aisle where practical; jacket life is a function of temperature.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 148,
      "versionNonce": 732303316,
      "index": "b0v",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e310",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1374.8301808434048,
      "y": 758.0214562596018,
      "width": 304.3716601150641,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786303577930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Overhead beats underfloor in a small\nroom: no plenum to obstruct, no fight with\nthe cooling, and you can see what you have.",
      "originalText": "3. Overhead beats underfloor in a small room: no plenum to obstruct, no fight with the cooling, and you can see what you have.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 567446228,
      "index": "b0w",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e311",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1374.8301808434048,
      "y": 813.0214562596018,
      "width": 302.9141199141177,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786303584538,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. If a raised floor is used for supply\nair, cable belongs overhead. Cable in the\nsupply plenum blocks the air you paid to\nmove.",
      "originalText": "4. If a raised floor is used for supply air, cable belongs overhead. Cable in the supply plenum blocks the air you paid to move.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
